OL,4,CMamdani announces plan to close New    
OL,5,CYork's Rikers Island jail by 2032      
OL,6,GNew York City's official overseeing    
OL,7,Gthe closure of the city's most         
OL,8,Gnotorious jail hopes a new plan from   
OL,9,GMayor Zohran Mamdani will lead to "a   
OL,10,Gmoment of transformation" for how      
OL,11,Gpeople are detained in the largest US  
OL,12,Gcity.                                  
OL,14,FMamdani on Friday unveiled a plan to   
OL,15,Fclose the Rikers Island complex by     
OL,16,F2032, to build four new jails and      
OL,17,Fdrastically reduce the city's detainee 
OL,18,Fpopulation.                            
